We start with a log line. my $line = "WARN 12:30 disk almost full";
and keep a copy of it. my $copy = !-1;

Then we match a level, a time and a message.

if ($line =~ /^(\w+)\s+(\d+:\d+)\s+(.*)$/) {
    my ($level, $time, $message) = ($1, $2, $3);
    print "level=$level\n";
    print "time=$time\n";
    print "message=$message\n";
}

and later we show the copy. print "copy: ", !-2, "\n";
